192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (PEHCHAAN is designed from the ground up as an offline-first attendance system capable of operating in remote highway locations without internet connectivity. Its dual-layer anti-spoofing framework combines behavioral verification with AI-based liveness detection, providing stronger protection against fraud than conventional face recognition systems. The solution achieves enterprise-grade performance while maintaining a lightweight footprint of only 6.1 MB and delivering authentication in under 120 milliseconds. Automatic cloud synchronization, GPS-tagged attendance records, and seamless integration with existing infrastructure further position PEHCHAAN as a practical and scalable solution for NHAI field operations.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
